{
  "title": "GridDog — Host Disk",
  "description": "Disk-space investigation dashboard for the 4 GridDog VMs. See `deploy/vm/ansible/README.md#disk-space-runbook` for the runbook this dashboard is paired with.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## GridDog — Host Disk\n\nUse this dashboard alongside the **[Disk space runbook](https://github.com/)** in `deploy/vm/ansible/README.md`.\n\n**Threshold reference:**\n- < 50% — healthy\n- 60–80% — yellow flag\n- **> 80% — alert fires (`[GridDog] Host root disk usage high`)**\n- > 90% — critical, host risk\n\n**When alert fires:** drill into the timeseries below to find which host and how fast it's climbing, then jump to the runbook for cleanup commands.",
        "background_color": "yellow",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 2}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Max disk % used across hosts",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "number_format": {"unit": {"type": "canonical_unit", "unit_name": "percent"}}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "max:system.disk.in_use{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}",
                "aggregator": "max"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 0.9, "palette": "white_on_red"},
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 0.8, "palette": "white_on_yellow"},
              {"comparator": "<", "value": 0.8, "palette": "white_on_green"}
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0,
        "timeseries_background": {"type": "area"}
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 3}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Hosts ranked by disk % used",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "toplist",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "number_format": {"unit": {"type": "canonical_unit", "unit_name": "percent"}}}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.in_use{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}",
                "aggregator": "last"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "sort": {"count": 10, "order_by": [{"type": "formula", "index": 0, "order": "desc"}]},
            "conditional_formats": [
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 0.9, "palette": "white_on_red"},
              {"comparator": ">=", "value": 0.8, "palette": "white_on_yellow"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 4, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 3}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Quick fleet-wide triage**\n\n```bash\ncd deploy/vm/ansible\nansible all -i inventory.ini \\\n  -m ansible.builtin.shell \\\n  -a \"df -h /\" --one-line\n```\n\n**Investigate one host** (replace `<host>`):\n```bash\nansible <host> -i inventory.ini -b \\\n  -m ansible.builtin.shell \\\n  -a \"du -h -d 1 -x / 2>/dev/null | sort -hr | head\"\n```",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "12",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 8, "y": 2, "width": 4, "height": 3}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Disk % used over time — root filesystem by host",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "{{host}}"}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.in_use{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal"},
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {"include_zero": true, "scale": "linear", "min": "0", "max": "1"},
        "markers": [
          {"value": "y = 0.9", "display_type": "error dashed", "label": " critical 90% "},
          {"value": "y = 0.8", "display_type": "warning dashed", "label": " warning 80% "}
        ]
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 5, "width": 12, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Disk used (bytes) by host",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "{{host}}"}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.used{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal"},
            "display_type": "area"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {"include_zero": true, "scale": "linear"}
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 9, "width": 6, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Disk free (bytes) by host",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "{{host}}"}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.free{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "dog_classic", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal"},
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {"include_zero": true, "scale": "linear"}
      },
      "layout": {"x": 6, "y": 9, "width": 6, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Docker overlay storage % used by host",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "query1", "alias": "{{host}}"}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.in_use{env:dev-vm,device:overlay,$host} by {host}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "purple", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal"},
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {"include_zero": true, "scale": "linear", "min": "0", "max": "1"}
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 13, "width": 6, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Disk used — rate of change (catches fast fills)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "legend_columns": ["avg", "min", "max", "value", "sum"],
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {"formula": "per_minute(query1)", "alias": "{{host}} bytes/min"}
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "query1",
                "query": "avg:system.disk.used{env:dev-vm,device:/dev/root,$host} by {host}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {"palette": "warm", "line_type": "solid", "line_width": "normal"},
            "display_type": "bars"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {"include_zero": true, "scale": "linear"}
      },
      "layout": {"x": 6, "y": 13, "width": 6, "height": 4}
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Cleanup quick reference\n\nFor full details, follow the **[Disk space runbook](https://github.com/)** in `deploy/vm/ansible/README.md`.\n\n**Truncate container logs (safe while running):**\n```bash\nansible <host> -i inventory.ini -b -m ansible.builtin.shell \\\n  -a \"truncate -s 0 /var/lib/docker/containers/*/*-json.log\"\n```\n\n**Prune Docker build cache (often the biggest win):**\n```bash\nansible <host> -i inventory.ini -b -m ansible.builtin.shell \\\n  -a \"docker builder prune -a -f && docker system df\"\n```\n\n**Apply log rotation everywhere (permanent fix):**\n```bash\nansible-playbook -i inventory.ini playbooks/00_host.yml\n```",
        "background_color": "blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {"x": 0, "y": 17, "width": 12, "height": 4}
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "host",
      "prefix": "host",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "*"
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "notify_list": [],
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "tags": ["team:griddog", "env:dev-vm", "resource:disk"]
}
